  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> be a point on the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and <math><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> be a point in the space. Then the value of <math><mi>&#956;</mi></math> for which the vector <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> is parallel to the plane <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is"
  },
