  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math><mi>A</mi></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>We know that the vector joining two points&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> which is parallel to plane <math><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>&#956;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#956;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
